<p>You draw constant power from the souls you hold within your grasp.</p><p>If you hold at least 2, your mana regeneration is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.5, 1.3, 1.9, 2.5, 3.0</acronym> per turn.</p><p>If you hold at least 5, your spellpower is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 20, 27, 34, 40.</acronym></p><p>If you hold at least 8, all your resistances are increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym></p>